d when exported to windows.\nThe stutter was much less noticeable on a dedicated graphics card, but it stops us from upgrading to 4.4.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open and start the MRP in Godot 4.4 -> will result in stutter\n- Open and start the MRP in Godot 4.3 -> will run much smoother\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp-particlesystems.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19339154/mrp-particlesystems.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"gwydi","id":25119274,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTE5Mjc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25119274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwydi","html_url":"https://github.com/gwydi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwydi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwydi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwydi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwydi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwydi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwydi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwydi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwydi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwydi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104360/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104360/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}